{
  "_comment": [
    "Where each material's scans come from. Everything listed is CC0 (public domain):",
    "Poly Haven (polyhaven.com) and ambientCG (ambientcg.com) both release under CC0,",
    "so these ship with the project with no attribution obligation — though both",
    "deserve the credit anyway, and get it in docs/MATERIALS.md.",
    "",
    "Run `npm run textures:fetch` to download, then `npm run textures:scan`.",
    "Nothing here is required: every material still has a painted stand-in, so a",
    "checkout that skips the fetch renders a fully dressed building.",
    "",
    "Resolution is per-material on purpose. 2k goes only to surfaces a visitor gets",
    "close to or sees at a grazing angle — floors, the walls at eye level, the",
    "carpet. Everything else is 1k, because a coffer 14 m overhead cannot resolve",
    "more and the bytes are better spent elsewhere."
  ],
